WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.386 --> 00:00:01.952
(people cinematically fighting)

00:00:01.952 --> 00:00:03.860
- Bam! Slammer that coat.

00:00:03.860 --> 00:00:05.568
- I love this bit!

00:00:05.568 --> 00:00:07.290
(intense music)

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:10.890
- Okay, so this scene,
this is episode two.

00:00:10.890 --> 00:00:13.027
This is our first moment
of peril together.

00:00:13.027 --> 00:00:13.860
- It is.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.780
- And all the bad guys are out to kill me.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.330
And you're in danger by association.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:21.929
And so, I'm gonna have to do
some slick gun slinging to get

00:00:21.929 --> 00:00:23.037
us outta trouble.

00:00:23.037 --> 00:00:25.343
And I think you're gonna
have to save my life, too.

00:00:26.278 --> 00:00:27.459
(guns whipping)

00:00:27.459 --> 00:00:28.025
(all cheering)

00:00:28.025 --> 00:00:29.125
- Let's go!

00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:30.257
- Slammer that coat! Spin! Bang!

00:00:30.257 --> 00:00:32.940
- I will never forget
being under that carriage

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:35.607
watching you do this choreography.

00:00:35.607 --> 00:00:36.440
- Yes!

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:37.273
- That's my favorite.

00:00:37.273 --> 00:00:38.106
That is my favorite.

00:00:38.106 --> 00:00:40.020
- That's real.
(laughing)

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.400
- Do you remember when you
were trying to teach me

00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.880
how to do this and I broke
Freddy's phone at your house?

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.290
- Oh yeah, the machine gun.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.262
This was so loud.
- Yeah, so loud.

00:00:48.262 --> 00:00:50.280
- This was can't hear, ear
plugs in... need, yeah.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:51.390
- Yeah.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:52.470
- And then this, this we did.

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:53.863
There was a lot me jumping for this.

00:00:53.863 --> 00:00:54.696
(gun shooting)

00:00:54.696 --> 00:00:56.070
- I love those colors,
too, with that coat.

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:57.120
- Boom!

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:58.320
- Tell me you stole that coat.

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:00.330
- Oh, they didn't let me take
it, everybody wants that coat.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:04.050
- I remember you doing that
move and I was off screen

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:05.970
way far away, taking little pictures

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:07.680
because I was just very impressed.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:09.840
- Before I kill you, I want you to know

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:12.930
that I brought in a madman
to capture your Wraith.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.370
My

00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:15.805
Wraith.

00:01:15.805 --> 00:01:18.180
- There she is.
(weapons clanging)

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:20.100
- That's cool.
(scary intense music)

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:21.330
- Hey.

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:22.890
- Terrifying, that mask.

00:01:22.890 --> 00:01:23.723
- Yeah.

00:01:23.723 --> 00:01:26.682
And me like trying to
get into the position,

00:01:26.682 --> 00:01:29.430
that was not planned.
(laughing)

00:01:29.430 --> 00:01:30.929
I thought they were
gonna cut that bit out.

00:01:30.929 --> 00:01:32.790
(giggling)

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:34.590
What was so nice in this season is that

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:36.750
Inej kind of gets her own enemy to fight,

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.510
instead of like a group collaboration

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:41.160
of Pekka Rollins or whatever.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.150
This is her story.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:43.740
And what I really liked about this scene

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.140
in particular as well, that
it was a man being on top

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:50.130
of her and reminiscing her
time at the Menagerie as well.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:52.410
So even though she could get
out of this very, very easily,

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:55.893
she was just kind of frozen in the spot.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.980
Eh, there she is.

00:01:58.980 --> 00:02:00.962
- Come to save the day, always.

00:02:00.962 --> 00:02:02.795
(gun shooting)

00:02:02.795 --> 00:02:03.628
Yeah.

00:02:03.628 --> 00:02:06.113
This is one of the first
things I did with Danny.

00:02:06.113 --> 00:02:08.690
- Was it?
- I think so.

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:10.710
So we actually filmed this
on my birthday as well.

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:12.244
- It was your birthday!

00:02:12.244 --> 00:02:14.611
I remember.
(intense music building)

00:02:14.611 --> 00:02:16.770
I love this bit.

00:02:16.770 --> 00:02:19.590
That knife was actually
not a CGI, that was,

00:02:19.590 --> 00:02:21.003
I actually threw it.

00:02:21.003 --> 00:02:22.500
That was so much fun.

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.630
- This was three nights.
- Yeah.

00:02:24.630 --> 00:02:25.980
- Very cold.
- Yeah.

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:26.813
- Yep.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:27.840
- Like, I had to keep
getting hand warmers,

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:29.990
so that my hands could
do the gun slinging.

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:32.490
- Thumbs up.

00:02:32.490 --> 00:02:33.323
Yeah.

00:02:34.170 --> 00:02:36.327
Here he goes!
(all cheering)

00:02:36.327 --> 00:02:38.760
- You kept, that guy got
so much ash in his face.

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:39.780
- So much ash.

00:02:39.780 --> 00:02:40.800
- What was that?

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:43.671
- It was like actor-safe powder.

00:02:43.671 --> 00:02:45.146
- Yeah.
- So he didn't feel anything,

00:02:45.146 --> 00:02:47.571
but it was so hard to keep throwing it

00:02:47.571 --> 00:02:48.687
in his face.
- Final shot.

00:02:48.687 --> 00:02:50.281
Boom.

00:02:50.281 --> 00:02:51.683
(Kit imitating music)
- Smoking gun.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.907
And if that is not a romantic scene.

00:02:54.907 --> 00:02:55.899
It's so sweet.

00:02:55.899 --> 00:02:56.820
That's so sweet.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:57.720
- [Kit] Yeah.

00:02:57.720 --> 00:02:58.830
- So it's Black Veil, then.

00:02:58.830 --> 00:03:00.570
- And I love how you just
go straight for your hat.

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:02.070
You're like, "where's my hat?"

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:02.920
- Where's my hat?

00:03:05.159 --> 00:03:07.909
(wall exploding)

00:03:09.705 --> 00:03:10.676
- All practical.

00:03:10.676 --> 00:03:11.509
- Was it all practical?

00:03:11.509 --> 00:03:12.870
- It was a huge explosion, yeah.

00:03:12.870 --> 00:03:13.920
- Yeah, tell me the truth.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.511
Did he drop the guns when
he was gun slinging around?

00:03:16.511 --> 00:03:17.860
- Never.
- Never drops his gun.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:19.683
He never drops his gun.

00:03:21.311 --> 00:03:23.012
(gun shooting)
(enemy wailing)

